<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL-bank peseta notes due 2001 AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL-bank peseta notes due 2001 AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned an AAA rating to the 10 billion peseta 5.284 percent bonds due 2001 of Deutsche Siedlungs und Landesrentenbank.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL-bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
